      "translations": {
        "en": "I said to Abu Abdillah (peace be upon him), 'I am a man with many ailments and diseases, and I have not left any medicine without treating myself with it.' He said to me, 'Where are you regarding the clay of the grave of al-Husayn (peace be upon him)? For indeed in it is healing from every disease and safety from every fear.' He said, 'When you take it, say: O God, I ask You by the right of this clay, and by the right of the angel who took it, and by the right of the Prophet who gathered it, and by the right of the Successor who settled in it, send blessings upon Muhammad and his family, and make in it healing from every disease and safety from every fear.'"
      }
